{
 "text": [
  "OUTREACH",
  "Ultro is committed to more than just building robots. Our holistic approach to connecting with the community enables everyone to",
  "engineer for humanity.",
  "INTRO TO ENGINEERING",
  "We created the ongoing 10",
  "th",
  "Grade curriculum class",
  "Intro to Engineering",
  "to acquaint sophomores with robotics, as well as",
  "increase interest in and visibility",
  "of the sport.",
  "FLL MENTORING",
  "We mentor FLL Team 65186 Panthers to teach them the iterative design process, spark joy & nurture interest in the FIRST sport of robotics.",
  "SCRIMMAGE",
  "Our annual scrimmage at The Browning School hosts teams eager to collaborate, exchange ideas & expand learning.",
  "FTC COLLABORATION",
  "For the 2024-25 season, Ultro team members mentored the rookie team 22053 Liberty Robotics and collaborated with all-girls 13334 Spence Light Sabers.",
  "ULTRO ROBOTICS YOUTUBE",
  "In response to the struggles and lack of resources faced by developing teams, we collaborated with NYC FIRST to develop a video series explaining challenging concepts.",
  "Visit our channel!",
  "SPEAKER SERIES",
  "Our ENGINEERING FOR HUMANITY speaker series connects Ultro with the greater STEM community and serves as a vital part of team learning.",
  "337 EAST 64TH STREET",
  "NEW YORK, NY 10065",
  "Ultro Robotics is the Browning School's premier FTC robotics team.",
  "This website is",
  "open source!"
 ],
